I know this is too late to help with the project, but could you give me
some feedback on the following?  As part of a redesign of the parser's
output facilities, I added a Prolog-format option, plus a separate
full-parse option that presents all rules.

Please note that all apostrophes have been h-ified, that selma'o names
are lowercased, and that inserted elidables are also lowercased.

$ parser -r -f           # -r is Prolog mode, -f is full parse
